  R3 (LEAK + STALE, NOT COSMETIC). Packet line 173-174 (master line 244, outside any redaction span): "*(What `root_origins` implies for a claim's outcome follows from the clause held in §3 and is not decided here; the field is factual either way.)*" Defect: (i) it tells the seat root_origins has an implication for a claim's outcome decided elsewhere — the very "conclusion rides on provenance" channel V11 moved into redacted spans — while packet line 16 asserts "Neither contaminates the other"; (ii) it is stale under option (c): "the clause held in §3" points at the HELD marker §10.4 records as removed, and under (c) no per-claim outcome depends on provenance at all. Exact replacement: delete the parenthetical, or replace with "*(The field is factual; no per-claim outcome depends on it.)*"
