Stall: the 120-second cap with SYMBOLIC_TIMEOUT as a reportable outcome has a filing home in REPRO_NOT_EVALUABLE ✓; limb durations are estimates and §10.5 says so for limb B ✓; C0's two-independent-seat reachability exhibition precedes any freeze ✓.

