  R9 (COSMETIC). census on a candidate record missing candidate_id dies with an uncaught KeyError traceback instead of a printed failure line; the exit code is still 1, so C1 fails safe. Exact replacement: validate record keys before access and print "candidate <n>: missing candidate_id" with exit 1.

VERDICT RATIONALE

The core architecture withstood adversarial construction and machine probing: option (c) makes every declared outcome reachable and the reproduction question decidable on every hardest case constructed (R1's boundary excepted); the provenance envelope is machine-checked and its residual asserted component (reason code inside a matched quotation) is covered by redundancy that is itself audited; the blind's redaction is machine-asserted and the assertion verified by re-execution; the seal's two receipts bind protocol and tally before the steps they must precede, with honest floors stated throughout. Every finding is exactly repairable: R1 one clause (totality), R7 one clause (vocabulary), R6 author-and-pin one artefact, R2 a control-token rename, R3 a deletion, R4 three neutralisations, R5 a re-pinned usage string; R8/R9 and the C0 token form are COSMETIC (no class filed, no control's passability, no reachability, no conclusion, no tested value changes). No defect lets the lane's expectation reach a filing, and none requires redesign. Hence PREREG_SOUND_WITH_REPAIRS. The repairs R1, R2, R3, R4, R5, R6, R7 are required before freeze; the cosmetic items may ride with them.

(R5 is stated at §4 above: the script's usage text omits MEASURED from the origin enumeration and states "DERIVED_ONLY if every root origin is DERIVED or STANDARD", while the code accepts MEASURED and computes roots ['MEASURED'] → DERIVED_ONLY, matching the master-only rule — the usage text misdescribes the delivered tool and should be corrected and the script re-pinned, with the new sha256 carried into master §3/C3 and the packet.)

